# RDF Unreleased Release Notes

## Unreleased

-- New Features --

[New] role-based model + effort routing: agent-meta.json declares model and effort
      per agent (planner fable/high; dispatcher opus/high; engineer and reviewer
      opus/xhigh; qa and uat opus/medium) plus variants emitted from the same
      canonical body as rdf-engineer-focused (medium) and rdf-reviewer-challenge
      (high); rdf generate and doctor catalogs reject invalid routing values
[New] rdf tokens: local token usage report from Claude Code transcripts (bash + jq,
      jq 1.5 floor; usage deduplicated by message.id) with list-price cost by cost
      class, model, agent, context depth, subagent boot, and effort; --json and
      --summary; /r-save records a per-session tokens summary, /r-start shows cost
[New] rdf doctor --scope harness (15th scope): WARNs when Opus 5.5 would run at
      its medium default, when CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL flattens per-agent effort,
      and when the Bash output limit exceeds 30000; reads settings, never writes

-- Bug Fixes --

[Fix] rdf doctor --json escapes quotes, backslashes, and control characters in
      check messages and names (a quote in any message produced invalid JSON)
[Fix] rdf-state.sh session_last prefers the /r-save entry over the trailing
      same-state SessionEnd-hook entries, restoring commits/diff_summary (and now
      tokens) on the /r-start Last line
[Fix] rdf_session_init adopts CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID (else mints a UUIDv7): each
      Bash tool call minted a new RDF_SESSION_ID, so session-scoped pointers (active
      plan, tier) were written but never read back and /r-start fell back to a stale
      plan; the worktree scope-guard hook now resolves the phase plan; precompact
      snapshots follow the resolver order (own pointer, project pointer, PLAN.md);
      /r-build clears a retried phase's leftover worktree; claude --resume reuses
      the id (use --fork-session for a second concurrent terminal)
[Fix] /r-util-claudemd-review read the unset CLAUDE_SESSION_ID, so the active
      conversation was mined as a past one; it now reads CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID

-- Changes --

[Change] dispatcher routes scope:docs/focused phases to rdf-engineer-focused and
         escalates a failed focused phase to rdf-engineer; challenge reviews from
         /r-spec, /r-plan, /r-review dispatch rdf-reviewer-challenge; no canonical
         routing site passes a per-invocation model any more
[Change] /r-spec and /r-plan carry a non-blocking Claude Code advisory to run spec
         and plan sessions on claude --model fable --effort high; the /r-plan
         handoff names the Opus build session; /r-plan stays in main context
[Change] rdf sync never creates a canonical agent (generated variants and stray
         output agents are skipped and counted)
[Change] checkout installs: run rdf deploy claude-code once to link the new
         state/rdf-tokens.sh helper (plugin installs pick it up on restart)
